# Docs screenshots: the editor manual's pages (docs/editor/<page>.md, #45) -
# one shot per part of the editor, named editor_<page> (scripts/docs/
# screenshots.sh copies them into docs/images/).
wait 8
key escape

# --- The main window's parts ---
click @hier:PlayerShip
wait 3
annotate @window:toolbar Tools, Play / Simulate, grid and snapping, zoom, save, export, settings
click @menu:File
wait 2
screenshot editor_toolbar-menus
key escape

annotate @window:scene The scene's nodes: select, drag to re-parent, right-click for more
annotate @hier:PlayerShip The selected node (the eye shows / hides it)
screenshot editor_scene-tree

annotate @insp.name The node's name, enable / visible toggles and its documentation (?)
annotate @window:inspector Transform, then the node type's own sections and properties
screenshot editor_inspector

annotate @node:PlayerShip Drag to move; the handles scale it
annotate @window:viewport Pan with the middle mouse, zoom with the wheel, Home fits the scene
screenshot editor_viewport

click @asset:textures/Asteroid_2.png
wait 3
annotate @window:assets The project's files by folder: scenes, scripts, textures, sounds, components
annotate @window:preview The selected asset: its preview and import settings
screenshot editor_assets

key ctrl+comma
wait 3
screenshot editor_settings
key escape
wait 2

# --- The bottom tabs (the Animation workspace gives them room) ---
click @menu:View
click @menu:View/Workspaces
click @menu:Workspaces/Animation
wait 3

click @bottom:console
wait 2
screenshot editor_tab-console

click @bottom:profiler
wait 30
screenshot editor_tab-profiler

click @hier:StarfieldEmitter
click @bottom:particles
wait 3
screenshot editor_tab-particles

click @bottom:mixer
wait 2
screenshot editor_tab-mixer
